"angi at standard faktureringsadresse skal være den samme som "
"leveringsadressen i <a href=\"%s\">Fluid Checkout-innstillingene</a>."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-wc-shipping.php:39
msgid ""
"This option is managed in Fluid Checkout. The shipping destination is "
